ones Industrial Average futures up 282 points, 28 of the Dow's 30 components were trading higher ahead of the open. Among the biggest gainers, shares of Cisco Systems Inc. (CSCO) climbed 2.5%, DowDuPont Inc. (DWDP) rose 2.0% and Walt Disney Co. (DIS) advanced 1.8%. The two decliners were shares of Travelers Companies Inc. (TRV), which slipped 0.1%, and United Technologies Corp. (UTX), which lost less than 0.1%. Among the more active shares, Apple Inc. (AAPL) gained 1.5% and General Electric Co. (GE) tacked on 0.7%.\n-Tomi Kilgore;\n 0809ET\n ", "external_links": ["http://www.addthis.com/bookmark.php?v=250"], "published": "2018-02-12T02:00:00.000+02:00", "crawled": "2018-02-12T15:21:00.000+02:00", "highlightTitle": ""}